  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "p00000",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 1,
      "text_preview": "姚秦天竺三藏鳩摩羅什譯",
      "char_count": 11,
      "section_type": "译者署名",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00001",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 2,
      "text_preview": "如是我聞：",
      "char_count": 5,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00002",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 3,
      "text_preview": "一時，佛在舍衛國祇樹給孤獨園，與大比丘眾千二百五十人俱。爾時，世尊食時，著衣持鉢，入舍衛大城乞食。於其城中，次第乞已，還至本處。飯食訖，收衣鉢，洗足已，敷座而坐",
      "char_count": 81,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00003",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 4,
      "text_preview": "時，長老須菩提在大眾中即從座起，偏袒右肩，右膝著地，合掌恭敬而白佛言：「希有世尊！如來善護念諸菩薩，善付囑諸菩薩。世尊！善男子、善女人，發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心，",
      "char_count": 93,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00004",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 5,
      "text_preview": "佛言：「善哉，善哉！須菩提！如汝所說：『如來善護念諸菩薩，善付囑諸菩薩。』汝今諦聽，當為汝說。善男子、善女人，發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心，應如是住，如是降伏其心。」",
      "char_count": 80,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00005",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 6,
      "text_preview": "「唯然。世尊！願樂欲聞。」",
      "char_count": 13,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00006",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 7,
      "text_preview": "佛告須菩提：「諸菩薩摩訶薩應如是降伏其心：『所有一切眾生之類，若卵生、若胎生、若濕生、若化生，若有色、若無色，若有想、若無想、若非有想非無想，我皆令入無餘涅槃而",
      "char_count": 140,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00007",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 8,
      "text_preview": "「復次，須菩提！菩薩於法應無所住行於布施，所謂不住色布施，不住聲、香、味、觸、法布施。須菩提！菩薩應如是布施，不住於相。何以故？若菩薩不住相布施，其福德不可思量",
      "char_count": 81,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00008",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 9,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？東方虛空可思量不？」",
      "char_count": 20,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00009",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 10,
      "text_preview": "「不也，世尊！」",
      "char_count": 8,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00010",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 11,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！南、西、北方，四維、上、下虛空可思量不？」",
      "char_count": 26,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00011",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 12,
      "text_preview": "「不也，世尊！」",
      "char_count": 8,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00012",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 13,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！菩薩無住相布施，福德亦復如是不可思量。須菩提！菩薩但應如所教住。",
      "char_count": 37,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00013",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 14,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？可以身相見如來不？」",
      "char_count": 20,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00014",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 15,
      "text_preview": "「不也，世尊！不可以身相得見如來。何以故？如來所說身相，即非身相。」",
      "char_count": 34,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00015",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 16,
      "text_preview": "佛告須菩提：「凡所有相，皆是虛妄；若見諸相非相，則見如來。」",
      "char_count": 30,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00016",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 17,
      "text_preview": "須菩提白佛言：「世尊！頗有眾生，得聞如是言說章句，生實信不？」",
      "char_count": 31,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00017",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 18,
      "text_preview": "佛告須菩提：「莫作是說。如來滅後後五百歲，有持戒修福者，於此章句能生信心，以此為實，當知是人不於一佛二佛、三、四、五佛而種善根，已於無量千萬佛所種諸善根。聞是章",
      "char_count": 137,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00018",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 19,
      "text_preview": "「無法相，亦無非法相。何以故？是諸眾生若心取相，則為著我、人、眾生、壽者。",
      "char_count": 37,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00019",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 20,
      "text_preview": "「若取法相，即著我、人、眾生、壽者。何以故？若取非法相，即著我、人、眾生、壽者。是故不應取法，不應取非法。以是義故，如來常說：『汝等比丘，知我說法，如筏喻者，法",
      "char_count": 90,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00020",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 21,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？如來得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提耶？如來有所說法耶？」",
      "char_count": 33,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00021",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 22,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「如我解佛所說義，無有定法名阿耨多羅三藐三菩提，亦無有定法如來可說。何以故？如來所說法，皆不可取、不可說、非法、非非法。所以者何？一切賢聖皆以無為法而",
      "char_count": 85,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00022",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 23,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？若人滿三千大千世界七寶以用布施，是人所得福德，寧為多不？」",
      "char_count": 39,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00023",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 24,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「甚多，世尊！何以故？是福德即非福德性，是故如來說福德多。」",
      "char_count": 35,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00024",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 25,
      "text_preview": "「若復有人，於此經中受持乃至四句偈等，為他人說，其福勝彼。何以故？須菩提！一切諸佛及諸佛阿耨多羅三藐三菩提法，皆從此經出。須菩提！所謂佛法者，即非佛法。",
      "char_count": 76,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00025",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 26,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？須陀洹能作是念，『我得須陀洹果』不？」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00026",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 27,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「不也，世尊！何以故？須陀洹名為入流，而無所入，不入色、聲、香、味、觸、法，是名須陀洹。」",
      "char_count": 50,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00027",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 28,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？斯陀含能作是念，『我得斯陀含果』不？」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00028",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 29,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「不也，世尊！何以故？斯陀含名一往來，而實無往來，是名斯陀含。」",
      "char_count": 37,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00029",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 30,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？阿那含能作是念，『我得阿那含果』不？」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00030",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 31,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「不也，世尊！何以故？阿那含名為不來，而實無來，是故名阿那含。」",
      "char_count": 37,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00031",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 32,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？阿羅漢能作是念，『我得阿羅漢道』不？」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00032",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 33,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「不也，世尊！何以故？實無有法名阿羅漢。世尊！若阿羅漢作是念『我得阿羅漢道』，即為著我、人、眾生、壽者。世尊！佛說我得無諍三昧人中最為第一，是第一離欲",
      "char_count": 155,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00033",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 34,
      "text_preview": "佛告須菩提：「於意云何？如來昔在然燈佛所，於法有所得不？」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00034",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 35,
      "text_preview": "「世尊！如來在然燈佛所，於法實無所得。」",
      "char_count": 20,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00035",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 36,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？菩薩莊嚴佛土不？」",
      "char_count": 19,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00036",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 37,
