      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00084",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 85,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？如來有佛眼不？」",
      "char_count": 18,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00085",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 86,
      "text_preview": "「如是，世尊！如來有佛眼。」",
      "char_count": 14,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00086",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 87,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？恒河中所有沙，佛說是沙不？」",
      "char_count": 24,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00087",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 88,
      "text_preview": "「如是，世尊！如來說是沙。」",
      "char_count": 14,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00088",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 89,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？如一恒河中所有沙，有如是等恒河，是諸恒河所有沙數佛世界，如是寧為多不？」",
      "char_count": 46,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00089",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 90,
      "text_preview": "「甚多，世尊！」",
      "char_count": 8,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00090",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 91,
      "text_preview": "佛告須菩提：「爾所國土中，所有眾生若干種心，如來悉知。何以故？如來說諸心，皆為非心，是名為心。所以者何？須菩提！過去心不可得，現在心不可得，未來心不可得。",
      "char_count": 77,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00091",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 92,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？若有人滿三千大千世界七寶以用布施，是人以是因緣得福多不？」",
      "char_count": 39,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00092",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 93,
      "text_preview": "「如是，世尊！此人以是因緣得福甚多。」",
      "char_count": 19,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00093",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 94,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若福德有實，如來不說得福德多；以福德無故，如來說得福德多。",
      "char_count": 34,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00094",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 95,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？佛可以具足色身見不？」",
      "char_count": 21,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00095",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 96,
      "text_preview": "「不也，世尊！如來不應以具足色身見。何以故？如來說具足色身，即非具足色身，是名具足色身。」",
      "char_count": 45,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00096",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 97,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？如來可以具足諸相見不？」",
      "char_count": 22,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00097",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 98,
      "text_preview": "「不也，世尊！如來不應以具足諸相見。何以故？如來說諸相具足，即非具足，是名諸相具足。」",
      "char_count": 43,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00098",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 99,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！汝勿謂如來作是念，『我當有所說法』。莫作是念，何以故？若人言『如來有所說法』，即為謗佛，不能解我所說故。須菩提！說法者，無法可說，是名說法。」",
      "char_count": 76,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00099",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 100,
      "text_preview": "爾時，慧命須菩提白佛言：「世尊！頗有眾生於未來世，聞說是法生信心不？」",
      "char_count": 35,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00100",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 101,
      "text_preview": "佛言：「須菩提！彼非眾生，非不眾生。何以故？須菩提！眾生、眾生者，如來說非眾生，是名眾生。」",
      "char_count": 46,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00101",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 102,
      "text_preview": "須菩提白佛言：「世尊！佛得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提，為無所得耶？」",
      "char_count": 30,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00102",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 103,
      "text_preview": "「如是，如是！須菩提！我於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提乃至無有少法可得，是名阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。",
      "char_count": 43,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00103",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 104,
      "text_preview": "「復次，須菩提！是法平等，無有高下，是名阿耨多羅三藐三菩提；以無我、無人、無眾生、無壽者，修一切善法，則得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。須菩提！所言善法者，如來說非善法，",
      "char_count": 85,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00104",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 105,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若三千大千世界中所有諸須彌山王，如是等七寶聚，有人持用布施；若人以此《般若波羅蜜經》，乃至四句偈等，受持、讀誦、為他人說，於前福德百分不及一，百千萬億",
      "char_count": 94,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00105",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 106,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？汝等勿謂如來作是念：『我當度眾生。』須菩提！莫作是念。何以故？實無有眾生如來度者，若有眾生如來度者，如來則有我、人、眾生、壽者。須菩提！如來",
      "char_count": 116,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00106",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 107,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！於意云何？可以三十二相觀如來不？」",
      "char_count": 22,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00107",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 108,
      "text_preview": "須菩提言：「如是，如是！以三十二相觀如來。」",
      "char_count": 22,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00108",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 109,
      "text_preview": "佛言：「須菩提！若以三十二相觀如來者，轉輪聖王則是如來。」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00109",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 110,
      "text_preview": "須菩提白佛言：「世尊！如我解佛所說義，不應以三十二相觀如來。」",
      "char_count": 31,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00110",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 111,
      "text_preview": "爾時，世尊而說偈言：",
      "char_count": 10,
      "section_type": "偈颂引导",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00111",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 112,
      "text_preview": "「若以色見我，以音聲求我，是人行邪道，不能見如來。",
      "char_count": 25,
      "section_type": "偈颂",
      "gatha_id": "g000",
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00112",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 113,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！汝若作是念：『如來不以具足相故，得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。』須菩提！莫作是念：『如來不以具足相故，得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。』",
      "char_count": 64,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00113",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 114,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！汝若作是念：『發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提者，說諸法斷滅相。』莫作是念。何以故？發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心者，於法不說斷滅相。",
      "char_count": 62,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00114",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 115,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若菩薩以滿恒河沙等世界七寶布施；若復有人知一切法無我，得成於忍，此菩薩勝前菩薩所得功德。須菩提！以諸菩薩不受福德故。」",
      "char_count": 64,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00115",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 116,
      "text_preview": "須菩提白佛言：「世尊！云何菩薩不受福德？」",
      "char_count": 21,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00116",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 117,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！菩薩所作福德，不應貪著，是故說不受福德。",
      "char_count": 25,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00117",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 118,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若有人言『如來若來若去、若坐若臥』，是人不解我所說義。何以故？如來者，無所從來，亦無所去，故名如來。",
      "char_count": 55,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00118",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 119,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若善男子、善女人以三千大千世界碎為微塵，於意云何？是微塵眾寧為多不？」",
      "char_count": 40,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00119",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 120,
      "text_preview": "「甚多，世尊！何以故？若是微塵眾實有者，佛則不說是微塵眾。所以者何？佛說微塵眾，則非微塵眾，是名微塵眾。世尊！如來所說三千大千世界，則非世界，是名世界。何以故？",
      "char_count": 113,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00120",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 121,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！一合相者，則是不可說，但凡夫之人貪著其事。",
      "char_count": 26,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00121",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 122,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若人言『佛說我見、人見、眾生見、壽者見』，須菩提！於意云何？是人解我所說義不？」",
      "char_count": 45,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00122",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 123,
      "text_preview": "「世尊！是人不解如來所說義。何以故？世尊說我見、人見、眾生見、壽者見，即非我見、人見、眾生見、壽者見，是名我見、人見、眾生見、壽者見。」",
      "char_count": 68,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [
        "p001"
      ],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00123",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 124,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心者，於一切法，應如是知，如是見，如是信解，不生法相。須菩提！所言法相者，如來說即非法相，是名法相。",
      "char_count": 65,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00124",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 125,
      "text_preview": "「須菩提！若有人以滿無量阿僧祇世界七寶持用布施，若有善男子、善女人發菩薩心者，持於此經乃至四句偈等，受持、讀誦、為人演說，其福勝彼。云何為人演說？不取於相，如如",
      "char_count": 87,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": [
        "c002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p00125",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 126,
      "text_preview": "「一切有為法，如夢、幻、泡、影，如露亦如電，應作如是觀。」",
      "char_count": 29,
      "section_type": "偈颂",
      "gatha_id": "g001",
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p00126",
      "chapter_id": "c000",
      "para_no": 127,
      "text_preview": "佛說是經已，長老須菩提及諸比丘、比丘尼、優婆塞、優婆夷，一切世間天、人、阿修羅，聞佛所說，皆大歡喜，信受奉行。",
      "char_count": 55,
      "section_type": "长行",
      "gatha_id": null,
      "mantra_id": null,
      "figures": [],
      "doctrines": []
    },
